BUILDING ON CURRENT macOS / APPLE SILICON

1. Open AppTrap.xcworkspace in Xcode.
2. Select the AppTrap scheme to build and run the background app.
3. Select the AppTrapPreferencePane scheme to build the preference pane.

CLI build:

    ./build_macos_m1.sh

Notes:

- Deployment target is now macOS 13.0 or newer.
- The old x86_64-only bundled Sparkle framework was removed.
- The old LSSharedFileList login item code was replaced with a user LaunchAgent plist in ~/Library/LaunchAgents.
- The update-check UI is disabled because the old Sparkle 1.x framework could not run natively on Apple Silicon.
